// M4 knowledge map (docs/v8/m4/M4_GOAL.md 3.1, ADR 0024). Loaded by
// sim_core::colony::knowledge::defs() (embedded with include_str!, parsed once).
// A node's KnowledgeId is its index in this list (file order).
//
// Fields: id, lane (eras.ron ids/aliases), era (eras.ron ids), tier, status, debt,
// threshold (‰ at which a person is a practitioner and may do the gated work), prereqs (ids; discovery only),
// difficulty (1–3: the discovery chance class), discover (settlement conditions, all must hold),
// gates (what only practitioners may do), marker_weight (0 = not an era marker), seed (who knows it at the start),
// name_key (locale key).
//
// Practice(job_kind: "craft", count: 3) reads completed colony jobs.
// Conditions: Stockpile(item, n) — n or more of the item on stockpile cells; Skill(skill, level) — someone has the
// skill at the level; Knows(id, permille) — someone holds the knowledge at the proficiency; ClayBankNear(tiles) — a
// clay bank within that Chebyshev distance of the camp hearth (worldgen).
// Gates: Recipe(id), Blueprint(kind) (building its site), Workshop(kind) (building its site), Designation(kind),
// Channel(apprenticeship | oral) (teaching fidelity / storytelling), Lore(what) (no job is gated; used in daily life).
// Seed: All (every founder at 600 ‰), Count(n) (n of 10 founders at 500–700 ‰, scaled to the founder count), None.
// Difficulty of discoverable nodes is not in the goal table: chosen in M4 DECISIONS D9.
